  "why_this_one": "A fallen black-and-gold knight, sat against a stone, about a metre tall, 11 placed (the port doc called them statues; in the world they lie and sit among the skulls as dead knights). 4-5 bones and no animation: MU draws the bind pose (key 0 is identical), so the OBJ is static. Scenery batch 4.",
